# --- Voice presets shipped with the repo: keep these TRACKED (do NOT ignore) ---
# Saved voices live in the (gitignored) DB, so they're committed as a seed instead.
# data/seeds/voice-presets.json  -> seed re-imported on startup (src/db/seed-voices.js)
# data/voice-refs/               -> reference clips voice clones need at render time
# Regenerate the seed after saving voices with: npm run export-voices
# (voice previews above are regenerated on demand and are intentionally not committed)

